{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "久", "id": "久"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "信", "variants": [], "id": "信"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "喜", "id": "喜"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "崩", "id": "崩"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "暴", "id": "暴"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "澤", "id": "澤"}, {"form": "聽", "id": "聽"}, {"form": "視", "id": "視"}, {"form": "覺", "id": "覺"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9318055428737713, "source": "先", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 3.378724525810097, "source": "先", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.056968685827777, "source": "先", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.6664065982618776, "source": "先", "target": "覺"}, {"weight": 2.056968685827777, "source": "久", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.6664065982618776, "source": "久", "target": "澤"}, {"weight": 2.3372706509819356, "source": "聽", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "聽", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.056968685827777, "source": "澤", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "民", "target": "暴"}, {"weight": 1.363821505267832, "source": "民", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 0.6706743247078867, "source": "民", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.0155148109996162, "source": "民", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "民", "target": "視"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "民", "target": "崩"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "民", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "民", "target": "從"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "民", "target": "覺"}, {"weight": 5.170483995038151,